Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:13.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.28,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It's always your dad who comes to fetch you. {Use Dad or Father, because -san is used which is formal}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi isn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa is my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:23.33,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:24.78,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,That's just weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.88,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone will have a mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.93,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Then what is Daikichi to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:33.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.46,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is always saying some strange stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:37.30,Default-Alt,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Guys can't give birth to kids, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:37.30,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:41.22,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay not to have a dad. Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.96,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The one who says that to others is the stupid one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.65,0:00:45.42,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Idiots! Idiots! Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.21,0:00:48.63,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:48.62,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:52.56,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun said I'm an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.56,0:00:55.07,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:59.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,At Kouki-kun's place, there's only your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:04.01,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dad went off somewhere we don't know, so they divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:05.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:11.00,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Means they're no longer married.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:15.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is my mom also not here because of divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.51,0:01:17.35,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.11,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get yelled at if you don't wear your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:24.18,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:27.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your string is loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:37.15,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he's here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.57,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:41.21,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:43.04,Default-Alt,Baby,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-tan, chomeone's...{Can't really tell if it's "ghost" or "catch"}{Bluebell says it's "omukae"(come to pick one up) which became "omake" kinda thing in baby language. So, something like this should work, but please change if necessary. -sm}{looks fine to me.-AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:48.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-kun, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:02:00.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:01.84,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,See you next time, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:05.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:07.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:08.81,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-Kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:12.28,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom is here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:54.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom is really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.42,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,But she's an irritating old hag at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:04.66,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki seems to be always under her care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.66,0:04:06.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:11.54,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,My son is hard to get along with, so he wasn't able to make any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:13.35,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really thankful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:16.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No no, it's nothing. W-We should thank you instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:19.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's also very hard to get along with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:22.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess they get along because they're so alike.{DISCUSS}{OLD LINE: I guess birds of a feather flock together.}{"birds of a feather" sounds bad no matter how you say it.  It's seriously old vernacular that's not current - AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:25.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you were talking about me just now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.98,0:04:27.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't say anything bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.77,0:04:29.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now quick, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:31.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask me to carry you on the way later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.05,0:04:32.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:34.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:39.07,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,She seems to be more attached to you, her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.07,0:04:41.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm not her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, something like her relative?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.07,0:04:46.07,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, seriously me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:47.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:49.97,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you're so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it great that you made a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:57.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!{Added. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:02.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know Kouki-kun? He doesn't have a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.86,0:05:03.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.88,0:05:06.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He said they're divorced and they're not sure where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.32,0:05:09.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,By divorce, do you know what it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:12.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It means they're no longer married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:15.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:20.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He'll probably be punished if God knows about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:28.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is my mom also not here because of divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.07,0:05:36.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:46.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:50.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see her if she's as pretty as Kouki-Kun's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:52.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,550)}Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.74,0:05:58.17,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?{What's that?}{That was the original line, please revert if necesary. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.13,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.99,0:06:05.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, the assistant at Grandpa's house is probably Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:07.45,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:10.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About that assistant, do you know anything about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.20,Default-Alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}This doesn't look too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:14.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A farewell party for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:16.58,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for having it so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:18.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I've finally finished planning for the Winter costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:22.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the offer, but I can't go out at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's only six, that kid at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.85,0:06:27.61,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you haven't gone drinking even once since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:30.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I can't go means I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:34.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, going out drinking no longer means that much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:35.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'm getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.66,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,About that, you're only in your thirties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:40.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, our people here may be young, but most of them have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They don't even have the drinking habit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:45.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have to go to the daycare to fetch the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:49.89,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The youngest of the two at my place is only three months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.93,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't hurry back, my wife will... {I don't know what my wife will do}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, what a monster wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:57.22,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty frightening if she gets mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:02.19,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.19,0:07:03.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:06.47,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard about the farewell party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:09.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. But it's impossible, since it's at night. {Added the "yeah", please remove if necessary. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.15,0:07:12.60,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something you get everyday; just bring along your kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:14.70,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm bringing my kid along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:17.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're actually thinking of going out drinking once in a while{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:18.68,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there's nothing bad about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.67,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I'm waiting for your good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:26.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:29.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:31.09,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:36.17,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Your Grandpa seems to have gotten the assistant from the agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:37.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:39.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.90,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako-san, comes from "righteous", while ko is from "children". {Yoshii Masako 吉井正子, 正(Masa/Tadashii 正しい)=correct/righteous, 子(ko) from 子供(kodomo)=Child}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.90,Note,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako 吉井正子, 正(Masa/Tadashii 正しい)=correct/righteous, 子(ko) from 子供(kodomo)=child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:47.23,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, that's the name that's written on the MCH Handbook, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:48.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:51.20,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you intend to contact her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:55.47,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Any person who could abandon such an adorable girl{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.66,0:07:55.47,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Calm down a bit, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.47,0:07:57.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've seen the MCH Handbook, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.34,0:07:59.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many things written there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:02.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There are still so many things we aren't sure of yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.11,0:08:07.59,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:11.00,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I said, work and family!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.00,0:08:13.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.33,0:08:16.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're late! Sit over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:16.97,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Stay away, you drunkard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.93,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:21.22,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You came after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:22.18,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.74,0:08:25.15,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, she's so cute~!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.29,0:08:31.94,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Eat as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.49,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.32,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for gracing us, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.24,0:08:39.08,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.54,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like orange juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:42.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is such a beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.66,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, a fine beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:46.64,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,She's blushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:47.92,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,So cute~{I think audio says "kawaii" ie "cute", so consider changing it. -sm}{Sounds to me like "Kawakute" got cut off, also "moe" is a prtty fringe/nebulous term, so I'm going with "cute".}{Okay, good job :D -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:54.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun, I'll help you gather them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:57.17,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:01.47,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, drink more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin might fall asleep on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:07.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to the restroom, Rin. {Daikichi uses 便所 (benjo) instead of トイレ (toire) which both means the same thing.}{This needs to be made an actual on screen subnote!}{Added. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:11.11,Note,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Note: Daikichi uses 便所 (benjo) instead of トイレ (toire), which both mean the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.49,0:09:08.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Use "toilet"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:11.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah right, toilet toilet. {Says so in the audio, please change if necessary. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.33,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,He abandoned everybody in the section.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:19.88,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,He shouldn't leave such an impressive record when he's about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.24,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Running away after winning, how despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:23.81,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The sales outlook for this month won't be optimistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.81,0:09:27.31,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the sales are decent, it definitely won't compare to last year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:28.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:31.17,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:35.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The me in the past would have jumped in, angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh dear, it's coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:40.72,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.72,0:09:43.56,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Now I feel like bringing you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:48.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The most important things to me have already changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:49.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:50.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:53.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,About your transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:59.04,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I understand somehow, after seeing Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:02.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?{Is that so!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:05.24,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like just carrying you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:06.49,Default-Alt,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Mama, Mama, carry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.24,0:10:08.50,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, she doesn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:08.49,Default-Alt,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Hey, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:13.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san, how do you feel about children?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel about Rin?{He says past tense here, but will look odd if changed. So am leaving it as it is. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:22.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You really like small kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:24.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, there's a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's going to be an elementary school entrance explanation meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I did nothing, and yet such a letter has been sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.82,0:10:40.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will there be an entrance test?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.63,0:10:44.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to take the test to enrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:46.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.20,0:10:49.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Compulsory education is impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:54.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Drunkard~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.57,0:10:57.92,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, darn, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:03.22,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Rin-chan, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.22,0:11:05.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(0,80)}S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:09.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh, everyone already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.01,0:11:15.10,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! Your mom is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:17.69,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.69,0:11:20.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:22.87,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's been... a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:26.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we still make it, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go and flag down a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:30.62,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.69,Default,School,0000,0000,0000,,The name tags we use here can be rotated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.69,0:11:39.84,Default,School,0000,0000,0000,,Please remember to flip it over, so as not to reveal the child's name while commuting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:43.54,Default,School,0000,0000,0000,,Also, don't leave your child alone in areas such as the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:46.26,Default,School,0000,0000,0000,,Remind your child not to go off with anyone even if they know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.77,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:53.49,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,The first things we teach our children is to doubt people, rather than trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The form that I took just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:00.24,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:04.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How do I know what kind of immunizations she's gotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:05.40,Default,Mothers,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:09.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:12.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I seem to have asked a senseless question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:16.13,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine. Do you have Rin-chan's MCH Handbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:18.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.63,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,There's a particular page that has them recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:22.34,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,So don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:29.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I really don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.45,0:12:32.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I only met Rin for the first time three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.22,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What? Three months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:43.60,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That's hard to believe.  It looks like Rin-chan really trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.23,0:12:50.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She always talks back to me at home, and also talks non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:53.08,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That proves that she trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:58.31,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,460)}No matter how I look at it, both of you look like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:12:59.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(450,0)}Family...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:03.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.55,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:08.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's true then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.06,0:13:17.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I jumped across your shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.82,0:13:27.52,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:28.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:33.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:36.05,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said, put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:41.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:44.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Backpack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:48.48,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.48,0:13:51.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The branded and nice looking ones are going to be sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see the fuss. I can just buy the normal ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:56.10,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Because she's a girl, so it won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'll take a look on the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:03.11,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, do you intend to continue raising Rin-chan like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.95,0:14:07.79,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, you even transferred to a different section, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:10.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't given much thought about the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:11.58,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:14.64,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Now, Reina will help you dry off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:15.54,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:18.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You two get along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.48,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.48,0:14:23.95,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mothers and daughters get along just like friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:34.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it, Mom and Kazumi get along very well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:38.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Masako-san's situation has changed, and she wants to live together with her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:40.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That is possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's gotten so many shots.{This line seems wrong, will ask ZY about it. For now, he seems to be talking that she left behind so many details... -sm}{"Jabs" is usually slang for "shots" as in needles, changing to "shots" since not many people who get that perticular slang.}{Neither did I :D Good. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:49.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is indeed being a mother{\fscx300}-{\fscx100} What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:58.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A will? ...Dapyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:02.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"This'll most likely get deleted if Masako-san notices it."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:06.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"So I chose this sort of under window approach."{Grandpa trying to say he is using this troublesome approach, but his phrasing and choice of words are horrible}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:11.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"But I don't know the proper way of writing a secret book."{Trying to say he doesn't know how the proper way to write a will is}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.30,0:15:17.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Besides, I'm trifling this strange keyboard thing having no progress at all."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:20.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is impressive, even if it's supposed to be wrong usage of words.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:25.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"It seems like this old man's is out of energy, thus I decide to give up the blog."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You give up way too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're born in the Taishou era! {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Taish%C5%8D_period}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"The rest to be continued in Rin-chan's MCH Handbook."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:40.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry Rin, I'm taking a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:51.88,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"I believe the person who finds this letter is someone who treats Rin like family."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:56.08,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"This will explain certain things about Rin and her mother, Masako."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:06.61,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"Masako is a person who is easily misunderstood."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:10.53,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"I'm saying clearly that she isn't a bad person."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:14.65,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"She said she isn't fit to be a mother."{Actually, a literal TL is: "She says she is a failure as a mother." -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.65,0:16:16.49,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"She feels bad for Rin."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.49,0:16:22.79,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"So she's only willing to appear before Rin as a house assistant."{手伝い tetsudai can mean maid or assistant or helper}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.60,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"I believe she will continue to do so even now."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.60,0:16:29.62,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"She feels that this will bring Rin most happiness."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.62,0:16:31.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.11,0:16:35.80,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"Even if something happens to me,"{"If the day comes when something happens to me,"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:39.68,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"she will be able to hide her identity in front of our relatives..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.68,0:16:44.14,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"...in order to carry on living cautiously without a trace."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.14,0:16:48.11,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"Masako really does love Rin as a mother."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.11,0:16:51.36,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,"But she's still very young."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:57.03,Default,Grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1500)}"Perhaps she isn't mature enough to be a mother."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really get what he's trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:05.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I can tell he holds important feelings for Rin and her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's no question about that.{"Only that cannot be questioned."}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:22.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.63,0:17:28.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You see, I want you to tie my hair up like a bunny. {We used "rabbit" in the prev ep, but once again I vote for "bunny", as it's more a term which a 6 year old child would use. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:28.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just like what Reina-chan's mom did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:33.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:34.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:36.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely not! It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tie it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:45.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because... I am not cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:49.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:53.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mi-chan said "Rin-chan is not cute at all."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.51,0:17:55.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,750)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:59.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No matter how I see it, Rin wins hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:02.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to look cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.64,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's already becoming a full fledged girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:15.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For her to care about things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san, do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:21.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's inner feelings have matured considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:25.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, some areas are maturing while others are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:28.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why we adults should look after her properly, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.57,0:18:31.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:38.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:52.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Twinkle twinkle little star~ How I wonder{\fscx300}- {This is the english version, the translated jap version will be placed on the website notes. But it will not fit the melody}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:52.86,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Hey Rin, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:56.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The Games Meet is supposed to be kept a secret from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.36,0:18:58.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? A Games Meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So you shouldn't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:04.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,S-So you're participating in that hairstyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:11.04,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Twinkle twinkle little star~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:15.39,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(640,580)}How I wonder what you are~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:20.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If the reason you abandoned Rin is to forget about painful memories of the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.57,0:19:24.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't hesitate to hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:28.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you have some sort of unique circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:29.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.76,0:19:28.60,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Twinkle twinkle little star~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.64,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2} How I wonder what you are~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:33.02,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2} How I wonder what you are~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.02,0:19:36.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,...something that could even lead to abandoning a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.01,0:19:37.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:40.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's true that it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.85,0:19:45.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you're going to be using it for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.10,0:19:46.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We need something more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:48.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.17,0:19:50.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about something more big-sister-ish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:52.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:57.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I want something more big-sister-ish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:19:58.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're sitting again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like a big sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:07.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, this desk set will still be okay even until you become a high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.99,0:20:09.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is a high school student an adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.14,0:20:13.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it's about halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to my reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.15,0:20:25.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A girl went into the forest alone to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:30.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The girl lost her way, and she tried really hard to find her way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:34.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But she couldn't find it, no matter how hard she tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.24,0:20:39.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She suddenly realised there was a tiny cottage in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.36,0:20:56.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Yoshii-san speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.94,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What? Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:33.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.59,0:22:34.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, not again! {Added the "Oh" -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.92,0:22:35.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.35,0:22:38.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:39.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:42.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:45.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you not to run off on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:46.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:49.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:51.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Something that will turn me into a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:54.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:56.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This will have to wait for a few years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.79,0:22:59.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
